{"id":"P033-1","subject":"P","unit":"P033","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P033-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n다음 항목에서 단상 3선식 배전방식에 대한 설명으로 옳은\n\n것은?\n\n  ㉠ 단상2선식에 비해서 전선중량비가 33이다.\n\n  ㉡ 단상2선식에 비해 전력전송가 133이다.\n\n  ㉢ 중성선 단선시 경부하측의 전압이 상승한다.\n\n  ㉣ 저압 밸런서를 사용한다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉠㉡㉣\n\n③ ㉠㉢㉣        ④ ㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":718},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1498},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m01-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m01-e3.webp","width":678,"height":712}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n극수가 10, 단중 파권 직류 발전기의 전기자 총 도체수가\n\n500, 1극당 자속이 0.02, 회전수가 600rpm일 때의\n유기 기전력V은?\n\n\n① 100         ② 200\n\n③ 400         ④ 500","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":524},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":637}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n다음의 신호흐름선도에서 전달함수 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                          \n①          ② \n\n                            \n③          ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":594},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":536}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n반지름 5mm, 길이가 15mm, 비투자율이 50인 자성체\n\n막대에 코일을 감고 전류를 흘려서 자성체 내의 자속밀도를\n50m로 하였을 때, 자성체 내에서의 자계의 세기는\n\n몇 Am인가?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②       \n                           \n③            ④       ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":719},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":724}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n30mH 의 두 자기 인덕턴스가 있다. 결합 계수를 0.1부터\n\n0.9까지 변화시킬 수 있다면, 이것을 접속시켜 얻을 수\n\n있는 합성 인덕턴스의 최댓값과 최솟값의 비는?\n\n\n① 9:1          ② 13:1\n\n③ 16:1         ④ 19:1","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1158}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n345kV 송전선로에서 송전거리가 345km라 할 때,\n\n송전용량 계수법에 의한 송전용량은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 송전용량 계수는 1200으로 한다.)\n\n\n① 138000       ② 207000\n\n③ 276000       ④ 414000","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":594},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1083}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n직렬회로에 직류전압 V가 인가되었을 때, 전류\n에 대한 전압방정식이 V이다.\n전류 의 라플라스 변환인 는?\n\n(단, 에는 초기전하가 없다.)\n\n\n                                         ① ×                    ② ×       \n             \n\n                                         ③ ×                    ④ ×       \n             ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":720},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":799}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n과도안정도를 향상시키기 위한 대책방안이 아닌 것은?\n\n\n① 조속기를 느리게 한다.\n\n② 직렬 리액턴스를 작게한다.\n\n③ 고장전류를 줄이고, 고속도 차단방식을 채용한다.\n\n④ 직렬 콘덴서를 설치하여 선로의 유도성 리액턴스를\n\n  보상한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":914}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n변압기의 단락시험에 대한 설명으로 틀린것은?\n\n\n① 임피던스 전압은 2차측을 단락시키고 1차측에\n\n  정격주파수의 저전압을 인가하여 측정할 수 있다.\n\n② 단락시험을 통해 임피던스 와트를 알 수 있다.\n\n③ 임피던스 전압은 정격전류가 흐를 때, 변압기 내부의\n\n  전압강하이다.\n\n④ 2차측 단락시의 입력은 무부하 철손이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":560},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":968}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n4극 60Hz의 3상 유도전동기의 회전자 속도가 1350\n\nrpm, 기계적 출력이 9kW일 때 2차 동손kW은?\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 5           ④ 6","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m10-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1061}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n자속밀도가 10m인 자계내에 길이 30cm의 막대\n\n도체를 자계와 30°의 각도로 놓고 이 도체를 20ms로\n\n자계방향으로 균일하게 이동하였을 때, 이 도체에 발생하\n\n는 기전력V은?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":654},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":821}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n지표면상 15m 높이의 수조에 51.98mmin의 물을\n\n양수하는데 사용되는 펌프용 전동기에 3상 전력을 공급하\n\n기 위해 단상 변압기 2대를 V결선하였다. 펌프 효율이\n\n0.75이고 여유계수를 1.02로 하는 경우 펌프용 전동기에\n\n전력을 공급하는 변압기 1대의 용량은 몇 kVA 인가?\n(단, 역률은 1이고, , 이다.)\n\n\n\n\n① 102         ② 100\n\n③ 86.6         ④ 58","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":626},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m12-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1132}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n                           \n다음의 변환 함수          에 대한 최종값은?      \n\n\n① 1           ② 3\n\n③ 5           ④ 15","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":439},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":750}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n3상 유도전동기에 대한 다음 설명 중 옳은 것은?\n\n  ㉠ 회전자의 회전방향은 회전자계와 반대이다.\n\n  ㉡ 864rpm, , 60Hz일 때 슬립은\n     4이다.\n  ㉢ 동기 각속도가 rads이고, 회전자 각속도가\n\n                                          \n     rads일 때, 유도전동기의 2차 효율은 \n\n    이다.\n\n\n① ㉠          ② ㉡\n\n③ ㉢          ④ ㉡㉢","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":706},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1150}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n다음 내용 중에서 SCR에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n\n ㉠ 단자는 그림과 같이 캐노드, 애노드, 게이트로\n\n    구성된다.\n\n\n             ⦁ : Cathode\n\n              ⦁ : Anode\n             ⦁ : Gate\n\n\n ㉡ 애노드와 캐소드 양측 단자간의 전압강하가 작다.\n\n ㉢ 도통중에 게이트 전압을 제거한 뒤에도 전류가\n\n    흐른다.\n\n ㉣ 역저지하려면 게이트 전류가 0이나 –1 이어야한다.\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉡㉢\n\n③ ㉢㉣         ④ ㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":738},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":732},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m15-e2.webp","width":696,"height":852}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  동기조상기를 역률1로 운전하다가 여자전류를\n\n  줄이면 역률은 ( ㉠  )이 되고, 전기자 전류는\n\n      ( ㉡  )한다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①     앞선역률         증가\n\n ②     뒤진역률         감소\n\n ③     앞선역률         감소\n\n ④     뒤진역률         증가","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":710},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1032}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P033-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n                       \n전달함수가          인 2차 제어계의 고유    \n주파수(rads)와 과도상태는?\n\n\n① 0.25,  부족제동\n② 0.25,  임계제동\n③ 0.5,  부족제동\n④ 0.5,  임계제동","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.04.27 한국수력원자력 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h1-e12-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":662},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e12-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":fa